      "kind": "SKILL_DEFECT",
      "rule_anchor": "Match § 815.18(3)(g) to a motor vehicle; when no used consumer-goods amount is supplied in this independent-pair task, its $4,000 vehicle amount plus unused (d) gives a $16,000 ceiling for one debtor or $32,000 for two equal joint debtors.",
